  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The logarithm of equilibrium constant for the reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><msubsup><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math> is<br />(Nearest integer)</p><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
